{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435890/extras/29007a01ca6902f0c9ca0e9f77625fbb.avif?t=1759518033\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong>Welcome to <i>Isle of Survival: The New Dawn</i></strong> \u2014 an immersive survival adventure where every choice shapes your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll awaken on a desolate beach and journey across a vast world of diverse biomes, from scorching deserts to frozen winterlands and lush, thriving forests. Gather vital resources like iron, lead, gold, and silver to craft tools, construct shelters, and push the limits of your survival in this expansive open-world sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on thrilling quests: uncover hidden secrets in abandoned housing developments, battle relentless zombie hordes, and unlock powerful blueprints that grant access to advanced crafting stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you brave the island alone or join forces with friends, <i>Isle of Survival: The New Dawn</i> delivers endless opportunities for exploration, building, trading, and survival in a vibrant, ever-evolving environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to carve your path and conquer the wilds?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435890?t=1759518033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435890/91d16eae86a982c4fa8c5b661828997f8fdfcac9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759518033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435890/1631fa6f458fab5667185c6b66dafc72cd3e4a49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759518033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435890/1631fa6f458fab5667185c